{'symbol': 'EL', 'date': '2019-10-31 12:30:00', 'title': 'Estee Lauder - Continue To Assume There Could Be Softening Of China Market In Future', 'text': 'ESTEE LAUDER EXEC - DISRUPTIONS IN HONG KONG AFFECTED COMMERCE IN THAT AREA - CONF CALL.ESTEE LAUDER COMPANIES INC EXEC - CONTINUED UNCERTAINTY ABOUT BREXIT IMPACTED CONSUMER SPENDING IN THE U.K.ESTEE LAUDER EXEC - DECELERATION IN COLOR COSMETICS HAS BEEN DRIVEN BY ANGLO MARKETS, BUT GROWTH IS STILL HEALTHY IN OTHER GEOGRAPHIES.ESTEE LAUDER COMPANIES INC EXEC - OUR SALES IN HONG KONG DECLINED 20% IN THE QUARTER AND WE HAVE NOT SEEN A SIGN OF IMPROVEMENT TO DATE.ESTEE LAUDER EXEC - MOBILE COMMERCE ACCOUNTED FOR MORE THAN HALF OF OUR E-COMMERCE SALES.ESTEE LAUDER EXEC - RECENT DECLINES IN COLOR COSMETICS IN U.S. ARE DUE TO TRENDS CHANGES AND POPULARITY OF MORE NATURAL APPEARANCE.ESTEE LAUDER EXEC - NORTH AMERICA BUSINESS IN TOTAL HAD A SOFTER MARKET THAN EXPECTED.ESTEE LAUDER EXEC - IN CHINA, LOT OF GROWTH IS COMING NOT ONLY FOR TIER 1 AND 2 CITIES BUT ALSO FOR TIER 4 AND TIER 4 CITIES.ESTEE LAUDER EXEC - ALWAYS IN MARKET FOR RIGHT STRATEGIC ACQUISITIONS THAT WILL REPRESENT WHITE-SPACE OPPORTUNITY FOR US AND SALES AND PROFIT GROWTH.ESTEE LAUDER EXEC - WE CONTINUE TO ASSUME THAT THERE COULD BE A SOFTENING OF THE CHINA MARKET IN THE FUTURE.'}
