{'symbol': 'LIN', 'date': '2019-10-31 22:30:00', 'title': 'Linde Starts Up New Plant for Electronics Manufacturer in Shanghai', 'text': "Linde announced that it has started up a new SPECTRA high purity nitrogen generator to support the expansion of a leading semi-conductor manufacturer in the ZhangJiang Hi-tech Park, Shanghai. Linde's nitrogen will be used throughout the new semi-conductor fabrication plant, supporting direct production process applications and the general purging and inerting of various semiconductor manufacturing systems. The new plant, installed and operated by Linde's joint venture Linde LienHwa (LLH), will also supply nitrogen via pipeline to existing customers in the industrial park."}
{'symbol': 'LYV', 'date': '2019-10-31 22:30:00', 'title': 'Live Nation Entertainment, Inc. Reports Earnings Results for the Third Quarter Ended September 30, 2019', 'text': 'Live Nation Entertainment, Inc. announced earnings results for the third quarter ended September 30, 2019. For the third quarter, the company announced sales was USD 3,773.684 million compared to USD 3,835.246 million a year ago. Operating income was USD 260.041 million compared to USD 234.219 million a year ago. Net income was USD 178.925 million compared to USD 172.683 million a year ago. Basic earnings per share from continuing operations was USD 0.74 compared to USD 0.73 a year ago. Diluted earnings per share from continuing operations was USD 0.71 compared to USD 0.7 a year ago. For the nine months, sales was USD 8,658.521 million compared to USD 8,185.945 million a year ago. Operating income was USD 407.764 million compared to USD 362.914 million a year ago. Net income was USD 229.836 million compared to USD 208.136 million a year ago. Basic earnings per share from continuing operations was USD 0.86 compared to USD 0.74 a year ago. Diluted earnings per share from continuing operations was USD 0.83 compared to USD 0.71 a year ago.'}
{'symbol': 'LKQ', 'date': '2019-10-31 22:30:00', 'title': 'Lkq Corp. Reports Earnings Results for the Nine Months Ended September 30, 2019', 'text': 'LKQ Corp. announced earnings results for the nine months ended September 30, 2019. For the nine months, the company announced sales was USD 9,496.249 million compared to USD 8,873.893 million a year ago. Operating income was USD 689.875 million compared to USD 718.095 million a year ago. Net income was USD 400.872 million compared to USD 444.069 million a year ago. Basic earnings per share from continuing operations was USD 1.29 compared to USD 1.42 a year ago. Basic earnings per share was USD 1.3 compared to USD 1.42 a year ago. Diluted earnings per share was USD 1.29 compared to USD 1.41 a year ago.'}
