{'symbol': 'XYL', 'date': '2019-10-31 22:30:00', 'title': 'Xylem Inc. Provides Revenue Guidance for 2019', 'text': 'Xylem Inc. provided revenue guidance for 2019. The company updating forecasted full-year 2019 revenue to be in the range of $5.24 to $5.27 billion. On an organic basis, Xylem’s revenue growth is adjusted to a range of 3% to 4% (approximately 1% on a reported basis) from previous guidance of 5% to 6%.'}
