{'symbol': 'ZTS', 'date': '2019-10-31 22:30:00', 'title': 'Zoetis Inc. (NYSE:ZTS) acquired Phoenix Central Laboratory For Veterinarians, Inc. from its 97 shareholders including Bob Kramer.', 'text': 'Zoetis Inc. (NYSE:ZTS) acquired Phoenix Central Laboratory For Veterinarians, Inc. from its 97 shareholders including Bob Kramer\xa0on October 31, 2019. Under the transaction, 440\xa0shares of Phoenix Central Laboratory For Veterinarians, Inc. will be acquired. Cascadia Capital LLC acted as financial advisor for Phoenix Central Laboratory For Veterinarians, Inc.\nZoetis Inc. (NYSE:ZTS) completed the acquisition of Phoenix Central Laboratory For Veterinarians, Inc. from its 97 shareholders including Bob Kramer\xa0on October 31, 2019.\n'}